  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 grant-Building strong political partnerships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is for SAIPAR to undertake research pieces in order to build and strengthen civil society&apos;s political engagement and influence in Zambia. The research pieces will focus on contextual (i.e. politics in the runup to 2026 general elections) as well as thematic political economy analysis, such as Access to Justice (anti-corruption and rule of law). Other research include women in leadership; youth and politics</narrative>
  </description>
